    <div class="about-prose">
      <p>After exploring several app-based business ideas, I realized that my experience helping teams build and deliver software could be a business of its own.</p>
      <p>Studio Ember brings together the work I enjoy most: architectural thinking, hands-on implementation, and collaboration between developers and the business. I think of my role as a multiplier—helping a team gain capabilities that continue to serve it after the project ends.</p>
